{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_grant_21.march","start_line":2,"start_col":4,"end_line":2,"end_col":8,"message":"Module `Main` uses `IO.Console` but does not declare `needs IO.Console`.\nhelp: add `needs IO.Console` to the module body.","code":"cap_ceiling:IO.Console","fix":{"kind":"insert","after_line":2,"text":"    needs IO.Console","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_grant_21.march","start_line":15,"start_col":10,"end_line":15,"end_col":20,"message":"`main` writes a file, but module `Main` declares no `needs IO.FileWrite`; its code also reaches `Cap(IO.Console)`, and `main` is granted nothing.\nhint: add these to the module body —\n        needs IO.Console\n        needs IO.FileWrite\n`main` declares no grant of its own, so the module's `needs` line is its grant.","code":"cap_needs:IO.Console,IO.FileWrite","fix":{"kind":"insert","after_line":2,"text":"  needs IO.Console\n  needs IO.FileWrite","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[{"file":"errors/cap_grant_21.march","start_line":16,"start_col":33,"end_line":16,"end_col":40,"message":"`main` prints here (`needs IO.Console`)"},{"file":"errors/cap_grant_21.march","start_line":14,"start_col":9,"end_line":14,"end_col":11,"message":"`main` is granted nothing here"}],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
